*> ********************************************************
*> PROGRAM : CRD0051
*> PURPOSE : CREDIT APPROVAL RULES
*> AUTHOR  : J.K.
*> CHANGE LOG:
*>   1987-05-18 ORIGINAL VERSION
*>   2003-12-09 THRESHOLDS UPDATED PER AUDIT REQ 410
*> RUN FROM JCL JOB CRDNIGHT STEP010
*> ********************************************************
IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. CRD0051.
DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 IN-RECORD.
    COPY CRD0051C.
01 RESULT-AREA.
    *> ASSIGNED CREDIT LIMIT
    05 CL-AMT             PIC 9(7)V99 VALUE ZERO.
PROCEDURE DIVISION.
A000-MAIN.
    ACCEPT IN-RECORD
    PERFORM SET-CARD-LIMIT
    DISPLAY "CL-AMT=" CL-AMT
    STOP RUN.
SET-CARD-LIMIT.
    *> PRIME CREDIT LIMIT
    IF WS-CSCR >= 760
        COMPUTE CL-AMT = WS-ANINC * 0.30
    ELSE
        IF WS-CSCR >= 640
            COMPUTE CL-AMT = WS-ANINC * 0.15
        ELSE
            MOVE 500.00 TO CL-AMT
        END-IF
    END-IF.
